  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;MS. EARTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ms. Earth is known for her service and leadership in creating an expansive garden and mural program in partnership with others."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAN 27, 2021&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jan 27, 2021 is a specific date mentioned in the context of an announcement."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TABATHA ROSPROY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tabatha Rosproy is an elementary school special education teacher and was announced as the 2021 recipient by the CCSSO."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JULIANA URTUBEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Juliana Urtubey is an elementary school special education teacher and was announced as the 2021 recipient by the CCSSO."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUNCIL OF CHIEF STATE SCHOOL OFFICERS (CCSSO)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Council of Chief State School Officers (CCSSO) is an organization that makes announcements regarding recipients of awards."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2021&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2021 is the year in which multiple events and announcements took place, including the CCSSO's award announcements."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ELEMENTARY SCHOOL SPECIAL EDUCATION TEACHER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Elementary school special education teachers are individuals who teach students with special needs in elementary schools."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GARDEN PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A garden program is a structured initiative aimed at creating and maintaining gardens, often involving educational and community engagement."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MURAL PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A mural program is a structured initiative aimed at creating and maintaining murals, often involving artistic and community engagement."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2021 AWARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 2021 award is a specific recognition event organized by the CCSSO to honor outstanding educators."</data>
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CCSSO&quot;">
      <data key="d2">rgb-0078</data>
      <data key="d1">"The CCSSO announced Tabatha Rosproy as the 2021 recipient, indicating a formal recognition of her work."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;MS. EARTH&quot;" target="&quot;TABATHA ROSPROY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">12.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both Ms. Earth and Tabatha Rosproy are recognized for their contributions in education, though in different contexts."</data>
      <data key="d5">"recognition, education"</data>
      <data key="d6">rgb-0078</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;MS. EARTH&quot;" target="&quot;JULIANA URTUBEY&quot;">
