    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GARDEN PROGRAM&quot;" target="&quot;CCSSO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The CCSSO supports and recognizes initiatives like the garden program, indicating a focus on community and environmental education."</data>
      <data key="d5">"support, recognition"</data>
